## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

The R1 fruit nucleus with a narrow bitter-green, coniferous hinge into cedar and vetiver. Twenty µL Juniper Berry EO and 10 µL Petitgrain EO Paraguay replace exactly 20 µL Hedione and 10 µL Iso E. The module must add transition—not gin, cologne, fougère, pine cleaner, or volume for its own sake.

